<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army has recently seized Bakori and Sali in West Kordofan while the Rapid Support Forces continue drone attacks that have killed civilians in the Blue Nile and White Nile, including a strike that killed nine civilians in the Blue Nile. Drones now account for two thirds of child casualties in the conflict. A senior RSF commander defected to the army after 13 years of service. Vinícius Jr of Real Madrid sent a surprise video message to a Sudanese boy who received prosthetic legs after a drone strike. There were 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/cm894wg251pzo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE9Sb255ek9CX0dfdjdIWUNqWDNzbUFKYWVjV1BQcDhXYXRkMV9kcjlaRG9EMGx1bWtBS1M4RmJCNW00N0d3MmJNa19DTm51S3c3cmZsLUVMcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTE5UbVhaRzhsVVJMZDFxci1aSFFtNnMtbHhVRDAxY2FPeFdreW1HU2ZpaFg4cmw4Vi13dDI5RmdHSmxSTFIwbFVqSVNiNzdXSlhZZXZRYkVpaWJ6eWhIZEdNdjRn?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOUmxJSTBtNC0zNWtPUkRhQ1JxS2dCRndtN3o1cURid3ZkdTRjTmthSmRubHJONFNBYlFLT1MwVGVyUENyNnYyYTU3Rnp5YjRSa3Z0NWprOWl6ckx4T3hXS3dGeThhZjlzWHFZSDNrX2VabUlaZWhKQUJORlJBYlFqNTJNYWRCaWcxLWhDTkxIRVl2Q2JvYlFVajdlN050dlI0?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNU0Y3N3dwVkdGV1BpRmwxQ0FIYmYxVlRabkE2VU96bEVLMVhGVG01VTd6VDdpWFM0bktUSTZJczFsX2pHWWZ6SjN3RUVBbGRwaGJJUWtOUUFWcW1CUVV6bzItdjNHVm0zUmJ5VEI4RVhDLUV2RFV4Z3d5NGphSER3cXFBTHg3RDV3Smg4c0tUTVFTUHg0X2paSmRORWk?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxNVFdzYT